## 6. Performance Qualification Tests

### 6.1 Test Conditions
- Product: {product name}
- Batch size: {size}
- Number of runs: 3 consecutive

### 6.2 Performance Testing
| Test ID | Parameter | Acceptance Criteria | Run 1 | Run 2 | Run 3 | Pass/Fail |
|---------|-----------|---------------------|-------|-------|-------|-----------|
| PQ-001 | Yield | ≥95% | _____ | _____ | _____ | ☐ P ☐ F |
| PQ-002 | Uniformity | RSD ≤2% | _____ | _____ | _____ | ☐ P ☐ F |
| PQ-003 | Assay | 95-105% | _____ | _____ | _____ | ☐ P ☐ F |

### 6.3 Statistical Analysis
- Mean: _____
- Standard Deviation: _____
- RSD: _____ %
- Range: _____
```

#### 7. Deviation Handling
```markdown
## 7. Deviation Handling

Any deviation from this protocol must be documented:

| Dev No. | Test ID | Description | Impact Assessment | Resolution |
|---------|---------|-------------|-------------------|------------|
| | | | | |

Minor deviations: Document and justify, no retest required
Major deviations: Investigate, may require retest or protocol amendment
```

