### CANNABIS-SPECIFIC CONSIDERATIONS

Include these for cannabis equipment:
- Containment verification (controlled substance)
- Cross-contamination controls (THC/CBD segregation)
- Cleaning validation requirements
- Potency testing equipment qualification
- Extraction equipment safety systems

